Title: 'Smelly cats' found in rubbish dump named after TV's Friends
Date: 2025-07-13
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [{'Speaker': 'Kim McNeill', 'Text': 'Centre manager Kim McNeill said the "strong bond and the laughter they brought to us" inspired the names and they had now all found "wonderful homes".', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 135}}, {'Speaker': 'Kim McNeill', 'Text': 'Kim said a member of the public contacted them after finding the kittens at the recycling centre in a "heartbreaking scene" on 27 May.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 4, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 112}}, {'Speaker': 'Kim McNeill', 'Text': 'She said: "All were suffering from severe malnutrition, flea and worm infestations, and painful eye infections.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 5, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 86}}, {'Speaker': 'Kim McNeill', 'Text': '"They were frightened, weak, and understandably wary of human contact."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 6, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 64}}, {'Speaker': 'Kim McNeill', 'Text': 'She said their vet team provided medical treatment for their eyes and the parasites.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 7, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 76}}, {'Speaker': 'Kim McNeill', 'Text': 'Kim added: "These kittens needed more than medicine - they needed time, patience, and love.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 8, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 78}}, {'Speaker': 'Kim McNeill', 'Text': '"Fortunately, one of our amazing foster carers stepped in and gave the kittens a safe, nurturing environment where they could begin to trust again.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 9, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 121}}, {'Speaker': 'Kim McNeill', 'Text': '"Over several weeks, they slowly gained confidence, learned how to play, and experienced the warmth of a home for the first time."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 10, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 106}}, {'Speaker': 'Kim McNeill', 'Text': 'After about a month in foster care they were "healthy and full of personality" and Borders Pet Rescue began to look for their "forever homes".', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 11, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 120}}, {'Speaker': 'Kim McNeill', 'Text': '"Inspired by their strong bond and the laughter they brought to us, we named them after characters from Friends - three girls and three boys," Kim said.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 12, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 116}}, {'Speaker': 'Kim McNeill', 'Text': 'Kim said their Kitten Friends had "captured hearts" on social media, allowing them to raise thousands of pounds for their veterinary care and spread the word about their search for owners.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 14, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 162}}, {'Speaker': 'Kim McNeill', 'Text': '"We\'re delighted to share that all six kittens have now been adopted into wonderful homes, each beginning a new chapter filled with love and joy," she said.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 15, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 122}}], 'Description': [{'Description': 'Six abandoned kittens suffering from fleas, worms and malnutrition have been rehomed after being found in a rubbish tip in the south of Scotland.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 109}}, {'Description': 'Borders Pet Rescue nursed the four-week-old kittens back to health after they were rescued from Eyemouth Recycling Centre.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 2, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 104}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'Six kittens looking into the camera'}]}
